WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.090
This is the Sword Zone,

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:05.850
a Zone where Digimon aiming 
to become true swordsmen

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.550
spar with each other fairly 
to test their skills.

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:15.490
But some bad guys have 
shown up to ruin all that.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:22.720
The Bagra Army!

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:25.000
Out of the way, brats.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.100
I don't think so!

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.540
Go!

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.570
Here they come!

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:40.540
<b>Taiki and Kiriha VS The Bagra Army:</b>

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:40.540
<b>The Full-Scale Showdown!</b>

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:38.570
Taiki and Kiriha VS The Bagra 
Army: The Full-Scale Showdown!

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:49.290
All that's left is the boss, Grademon.

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:51.900
But they haven't moved in a while.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.600
The enemy is strong. 
He can't be careless.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.660
He's a sword expert.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.720
The only opening we get is 
the moment when he attacks.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:06.010
Can you do it, X4?

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:09.450
Sure, these all-or-nothing 
battles are what I do best.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:12.520
Die, Xros Heart!

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:15.080
Cross Blade!

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:15.650
Now!

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:16.350
Right!

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:26.060
<i>Th-That tactic was...</i>

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:35.800
This is the end for you!

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:37.430
That's your punishment for being violent

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:40.800
to this Zone's Digimon, so you 
could steal the Code Crown!

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.180
They defeated the demonic swordsman?

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:47.220
Xros Heart are the saviors of the 
Digital World, as the rumors said!

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:49.050
Look at that!

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:57.810
It's the symbol of a true swordsman!

00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:00.800
You mean the Code Crown 
has approved of us?

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:04.180
You, true swordsmen?

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:07.140
How... How dare...

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:12.740
What's wrong, Taiki?

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:16.180
Oh... I just thought it 
looked really painful.

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:18.600
If only he were a good Digimon,

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:21.130
we wouldn't have had to fight him.

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:25.160
What?! He's an evil, no-good 
pawn of the Bagra Army!

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:27.390
Taiki is as kind as ever.

00:02:57.470 --> 00:02:58.260
What?

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:02.770
<i>Grademon has taken on a new form...</i>

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:05.900
<i>The Code Crown has that kind of power?</i>

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:08.030
D-Did you do that, Taiki?

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:10.850
Uh... I'm not really sure, but...

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:13.770
Anyway, I'm glad you're okay, Grademon.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.810
Don't be ridiculous!

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:19.380
This form is an embarrassment!

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:24.120
Next time we meet, I will show you 
the terrible might of my blade.

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:25.710
Don't you forget it!

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:29.550
Aww, he ran away.

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:32.530
See? He's not a good guy at all!

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:35.240
You're too naive, Taiki.

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:36.730
Sorry... But I...

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:39.400
Couldn't turn your back on him, right?

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.830
That's what's great about you, though.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:50.100
Taiki Kudou...

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.690
What is this feeling?

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:03.300
It appears you've sensed it, Lilithmon.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:06.620
It means the time has come.

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:13.000
Someone has obtained the 
108th and final Code Crown.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.710
I've been waiting for this moment.

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:19.640
Now I need only take it and 
present it to Lord Bagramon.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:25.280
Can I place my hopes in you, Tactimon?

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.590
Of course.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.500
I feel a showdown coming on!

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.650
I'm so jealous!

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.750
No way you can do that! No way!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.150
What did you say?!

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.700
No good! No good! No good!

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:39.120
Good no! Good no! Good no!

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:45.560
Now we have 31.

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:46.850
Taiki Kudou...

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:48.990
Huh? What is it, Zenji—

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:52.190
I remember now. 
I had completely forgotten...

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:55.300
That humiliating day when 
my sword lost to yours.

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:57.300
Fight me now!

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:58.480
What?!

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:00.780
What's gotten into you?!

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.700
Hold it right there!

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:02.880
Hold on! Just chill out!

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.050
Here! Here!

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:04.780
I can't reach!

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:14.110
Stop!

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:16.730
Cut it out, Zenjirou!

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:20.260
No! This Zone of swords has to be fate!

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:21.630
We're going to settle this here!

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:23.420
What?!

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:26.180
S-Stop! Stop it!

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:30.740
So he lost a kendo match 
to Taiki, a novice.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:34.180
That's why he's been following 
Taiki around all this time.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:37.050
I guess seeing X4's comeback attack

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:39.040
suddenly made him remember.

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:41.040
Sort of brings back memories.

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:43.970
Pick up your sword!

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:46.660
Actually, pick up some kind 
of stick or something!

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:48.930
Come on, give me a break!

00:05:49.270 --> 00:05:52.330
You two seem rather at ease.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.260
You're...

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:53.830
Kiriha!

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.530
What are you doing here?!

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:57.340
Haven't you noticed?

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:59.750
Now that Taiki has claimed this Zone,

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:03.120
the owner of each Code 
Crown has been decided.

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:06.560
The Digital World has begun to change.

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:09.440
I've seen with my own eyes...

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:12.780
the changes in the Zones whose 
Code Crowns you possess.

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:15.850
Zones that were once scattered

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.690
have begun to merge together.

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:32.840
He's been reborn as 
the good Leomon again!

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.860
That's great, Leomon!

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:37.180
What happened to me?

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.450
All the enemies we defeated

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:55.530
are being reborn as good Digimon?

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:57.160
How is that possible?

00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:59.430
It's your new power, Taiki.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:00.970
Huh? W-Wisemon?

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:04.120
You have obtained many Code Crowns,

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.270
so the Digimon you fought as enemies

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:09.370
are being reborn in the 
forms you wished for.

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:11.470
Even if they are destroyed into data,

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:14.020
a Digimon's soul is immortal.

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:16.660
So Digimon never die!

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:20.820
That's it! If we beat the Bagra Army 
and get all the Code Crowns back...

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:24.040
We can make a world 
with only good Digimon!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.530
That would be amazing!

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:27.640
What a boring world.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:29.910
I wouldn't wish for a world like that.

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:33.130
And there's no way they would, either.

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:34.460
They?

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:35.470
The Bagra Army?

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:43.870
Correct, red General.

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:45.540
That voice... Tactimon?!

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:49.510
Having the blue General here 
as well saves me some trouble.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:53.240
I will now cut off your means of escape

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:56.140
and take all the Code Crowns.

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:58.520
It will truly be perfect.

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:49.830
I have blockaded this entire 
Zone using that tower.

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:52.520
Nobody can leave it.

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:55.740
Now, let us fight it out 
to our hearts' content.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:10:01.020
I have invaded so many Zones 
just waiting for this day.

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:02.580
The battle is on!

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:04.920
Ichi-no-Tachi!

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:08.820
Now <i>that</i> is a master swordsman!

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:11.390
Let's go, guys!

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:12.310
Right!

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:14.890
Reload, Blue Flare!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:16.730
Shoutmon!

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:18.140
Okay!

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:19.000
Ballistamon!

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:21.340
Dorulumon!

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:23.250
Starmons!

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:24.540
Yes!

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.040
Sparrowmon!

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:27.940
Greymon!

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:30.440
MailBirdramon!

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:32.910
Deckerdramon!

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:36.310
DigiXros!

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:37.970
DigiXros!

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:40.890
Shoutmon X5!

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:45.620
DeckerGreymon!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.360
Again?!

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:54.290
I'll defeat this one.

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.640
He's a stronger Head 
Officer than Blastmon,

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:57.640
the one you defeated.

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:59.030
That's not important!

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:01.260
Our concern now is 
getting through this fight!

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:02.940
He's not an opponent to take lightly!

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:07.050
Kishintotsu!

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:09.940
Tanegashima!

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:13.320
I-I can't get a hit on him!

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:15.690
He's so strong for someone 
fighting alone...

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.320
We can't change Zones.

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.240
It's because of that tower.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:23.460
You understand, don't you, Kiriha?

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:25.450
Escape is impossible.

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:27.470
The only way is to fight and beat him.

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:32.990
I know you're not stupid enough 
to cling to your silly pride now.

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:36.950
You are good at manipulating people.

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:39.010
You're saying I should cooperate 
with Taiki, aren't you?

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:40.910
Way to go, Nene!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:43.720
What?! What's going on?!

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.050
You two aren't getting all friendly...

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:47.320
are you?

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:49.990
Get up, Taiki. Help me.

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:53.370
What's with you? You're just 
going to do as Nene says?

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:54.890
Quiet! Let's do this!

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:57.800
Shoutmon X5! Use Meteor Impact!

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:00.790
Together, DeckerGreymon!

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:02.770
Plasma Deckerdra-launcher!

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:03.650
Right!

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:08.870
Meteor Impact!

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:13.110
Plasma Deckerdra-launcher!

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:16.780
Take this!

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:29.540
Not bad, for a futile last-ditch effort.

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.300
But this is the end for you.

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:34.700
Ni-no-Tachi!

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:45.520
Everyone get back!

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:48.550
What kind of attack is this?

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:51.240
My sword is so powerful,

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:55.420
my Emperor Bagramon had 
to put a seal on it.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:57.890
Now that seal has been lifted.

00:12:58.240 --> 00:13:01.490
So you were saving your strength 
in all those other battles?!

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:02.850
Correct.

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:07.320
Vanquished Digimon whose data 
roam about the Digital World

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:11.100
are awakened as evil spirits 
in this attack, Ni-no-Tachi.

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:13.140
<i>Data... As evil spirits?</i>

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:17.940
And this is my ultimate technique...

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:27.140
San-no-Tachi!

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:37.160
It's gonna give me swept-back hair!

00:13:57.020 --> 00:14:00.250
I will not say this was too easy.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:04.620
Just forcing me to release the 
seal on my sword was commendable.

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:09.750
The Code Crowns!

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:10.760
The enemy is taking them!

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:14.370
Are you watching, Lord Bagramon?

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:17.670
Along with the 24 
collected by Lilithmon,

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:19.140
we now have 108.

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:22.890
All the Code Crowns are now yours.

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:25.680
Well done, Tactimon.

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:26.980
I-Is that voice...

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:28.150
The enemy leader?

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:30.280
Emperor Bagramon?

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:33.690
Bring them to me now.

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:34.350
Yes, my lord.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.400
What do you want?

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:47.470
This is bad!

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:50.740
No! If the Bagra Army gets those...

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:53.710
The Digital World will become hell!

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:56.270
That's right! If they take them,

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:59.060
even the Digimon who could 
have been reborn good

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:01.310
will be turned into evil spirits 
like those things before!

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:04.640
And what is wrong with that?

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:07.850
Worthless data of 
Digimon who lost in battle

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:10.620
should be grateful to 
have that data reused.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:11.700
Don't be crazy!

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:14.880
Who decided that someone 
who loses is worthless?!

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:17.330
Anyone can try again!

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:19.360
That's what a truly good world is!

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:21.250
You're right, Taiki.

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:23.110
Even if you lose, as long 
as your spirit's not broken,

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:24.320
that's good enough.

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:27.870
As long as you can say that...

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:30.240
We'll get back on our feet 
as many times as it takes!

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:37.260
They got up?

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:39.890
Even after taking my San-no-Tachi...

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:43.340
Your way of thinking is 
dangerous, Taiki Kudou.

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:46.740
I thought just having the 
Code Crowns would be enough,

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:49.460
but I will now take your life as well!

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:50.480
Stop!

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:56.200
What?!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.830
Why, you... Grademon!

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:01.870
What are you doing?!

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:05.000
I don't know, Lord Tactimon.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:09.930
This amazing boy who 
saved me, his enemy...

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:12.420
For some reason, I couldn't 
turn my back on him.

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:16.140
<i>That's right... He's the one I...</i>

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:21.910
<i>I thought, if only he 
were a good Digimon...</i>

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.660
<i>That's why he...</i>

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.150
G-Grademon!

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:30.450
How was that, Taiki Kudou?

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:32.500
Now do you see the true 
might of my sword?

00:16:32.980 --> 00:16:35.410
Yeah! It was amazing!

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:37.940
Now for the finish.

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:41.310
Sorry to do this to the 
new body you gave me,

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:43.750
but it's the only weapon I have left.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:47.420
Wh-What are you...

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:48.790
Grademon, don't!

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:50.210
You must escape!

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:54.390
Thank you for granting me a 
moment's justice, Taiki Kudou!

00:16:58.190 --> 00:16:59.880
Grademon!

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:04.500
I don't believe it.

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:10.270
What a devilish boy you are.

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:13.280
You will not be excused 
for deceiving my minion!

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:17.510
He was finally given a good heart...

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:20.850
You're the inexcusable ones!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:22.250
Ridiculous!

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.270
Beelzebumon!

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.050
Thanks to that explosion,

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:30.500
I was finally able to get in here.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:32.060
Everyone ready?

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:33.610
Anytime!

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:36.600
My anger has drowned out 
all the pain, Taiki!

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:46.620
Shoutmon!

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.010
Okay!

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:48.880
Ballistamon!

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:51.410
Dorulumon!

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:52.880
Starmons!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.360
Yes!

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:57.060
Sparrowmon!

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:58.120
Beelzebumon!

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:00.830
DigiXros!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:10.360
Shoutmon X5B!

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:14.570
Take this! Ni-no-Tachi!

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:22.280
The same trick won't work again!

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:23.980
Reload, Xros Heart!

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:28.220
It's a festival!

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:28.820
Interesting.

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:31.910
Knight!

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:35.990
This time, I will end you!

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:37.430
San-no-Tachi!

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:38.960
A sword master is only open...

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:40.550
...when he's attacking!

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:45.970
Thanks, guys!

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.160
Chaos Flare!

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:55.850
5B Victorize!

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:01.740
He stopped it?!

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:07.240
All right!

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:11.050
Burst Dash Stream!

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:16.910
All right! Way to go!

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:17.970
What's that?

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:19.990
A tornado?

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:26.010
Super-dimensional Storm!

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:34.750
He's taking all the Code Crowns!

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.020
Taiki!

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:44.030
Lord Bagramon! Tactimon is...

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:48.770
Does Taiki Kudou appear 
that dangerous to you?

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:50.750
He is dangerous.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:54.670
Hiding within him is something that 
causes changes in the Digital World.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:56.680
However, it will not appear again.

00:19:56.680 --> 00:20:01.200
And I now have all the Code Crowns.

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:05.410
Well done, Brother.

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:07.120
B-Brother?!

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:19.350
Ow...

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:22.500
Were we sent all the way 
out here by Bagramon?

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.400
What Zone is this?

00:20:25.400 --> 00:20:26.490
Something's wrong!

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:29.140
Taiki, I'm the only one 
in the Xros Loader!

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:29.940
What?!

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:32.850
We left everyone else in the last Zone!

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:33.540
Hey...

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.480
Why am I so tiny?!

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:37.500
What kind of Zone is this?

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:38.520
It's not a Zone.

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:42.300
This isn't the Digital World.

